# Top of the walls seen from above, for a Godot TileSet terrain in
# "Match Sides" mode. walltop_NN: NN = sum of connected sides N=1 E=2 S=4
# W=8. Wall faces (face_upper, face_lower) go below the southern edge.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_topdown_walltop.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_topdown_walltop_x4.png 4
@columns 4

